<title>USA: Vie de France Corp Q1 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Vie de France Corp Q1 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>VIE DE FRANCE CORP.</p>
<p>		     CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>						    First quarter</p>
<p>							 Twelve weeks ended</p>
<p>					    Sept. 21,	   Sept. 16,</p>
<p>						   1996		  1995</p>
<p> Net sales				$2,782,000	 $3,862,000</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold		    2,565,000	  3,486,000</p>
<p>	Gross margin			 217,000	    376,000</p>
<p> Selling and administration	    768,000	    927,000</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortization	  24,000	     26,000</p>
<p>     Total nonoperating income	 177,000	    230,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)			 (301,000)	   40,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per common share    (0.02)	   0.00</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>						 13,822,543    13,780,338</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
<p>NOTE: First-quarter sales were down from year-ago figures in part because of $700,000 in one-time sales to Sam's Club and to customers in Japan.</p>
